        "created_at": "2014-04-09T15:39:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I once had a team almost wipe due to Fixed Point shenanigans. &nbsp;It was vs. Baron Blade. &nbsp;Setback had just Risked Silver Lining, thankfully, and could get the last hit on the Baron. &nbsp;Everyone else died when we were required to destroy Ongoings or take damage. &nbsp;Dang you, fixed point! &nbsp;*shakes fist* &nbsp;Cheaters never win....</p>",
